BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (possible. So an $8,000 bill that eventually settles at $6,000 'was never 8,000 to begin with' in the carrier's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (math [PqL0m54Gjb4 @ 00:04:07]. Carriers owe for damages, defined as cost incurred. That is why) Tj ET
