BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (biggest myth in the industry. Albi has coached dozens of contractors who built their own bills and were paid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (in full by both homeowners and insurance companies without it [kSobDHWEZJE @ 00:19:21]. Shane) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (O'Dazier went further. Shane keeps Xactimate optional for reconstruction but pulled mitigation off it entirely,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (arguing that parent company Verisk assists in underwriting policies and earns most of its software revenue) Tj ET
