BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Title: Clean, verify, then deodorize and seal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Action: Remove residue physically, prove it with a sponge test, then deodorize and seal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Detail: Run a 1 ft by 1 ft sponge test with horizontal and vertical passes; the post-clean pass should come up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (clean before any deodorization or sealer goes on [Encircle - 33iGNdZ6fyE @ 00:45:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (Adjuster TV's walkthrough with Kylee Kempton of Titan Restoration in Mesa gives the tightest scan protocol.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (Water technicians carry a Matterport in every truck, shoot a pre-scan before mitigation and a post-scan after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (demolition, so the adjuster sees removed versus to-repair work, with Mattertags carrying loss descriptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (and quantities [86mEe0yHwiw @ 00:06:43]. The capture rules: place scans 5 to 8 ft apart, hold the camera) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (at about 4 to 4.5 ft for restoration rather than eye level, hide behind it to avoid "no alignment" errors, scan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (just before and after doorways, close blinds so sunlight does not confuse the infrared, mark mirrors early) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (and often, open doors to 45 degrees, and add 2 to 3 extra scans in tight bathrooms [86mEe0yHwiw @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (00:13:42]. For under-sink losses, open the cabinets and drop the tripod to its lowest height. The magicplan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (workflow layers moisture data on the sketch: insert a restoration humidity and temperature object, drag it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (onto the annotated humid zone, and log surface and air humidity, date and photos as custom attributes) Tj ET
