BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (an "absolutely not," because it bleaches anything damp and takes years off leather. Coy runs hydroxyl) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (inside the drying chamber instead, since it is safe for occupants and works on wet goods [MkCNqNRsk04 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (00:06:05]. Chris, the umpire-appraiser teaching Encircle's bootcamp, reverses that ranking. On protein fires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Chris rates ozone above hydroxy and calls hydroxy three to four times weaker. Chris still holds that the most) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (effective removal is physical, not hydroxy, and warns that whoever over-oxidizes a house owns the result) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm ([33iGNdZ6fyE @ 02:59:48]. The lever Chris prefers was used by only 3 to 4 percent of attendees: fresh-air) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (dilution. The reasoning is that bringing fresh air in carries less risk than applying another product) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm ([33iGNdZ6fyE @ 03:02:49]. Travis Chauncey at Abbotts Cleanup & Restoration runs a homeowner-grade) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (version. Open doors and windows, put positive air pressure in some areas and negative air machines in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (affected ones, and move to demolition only if the odor persists [iiCSRcut-WA @ 00:00:43]. The working read) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (is that contents crews lean toward hydroxyl, while structure-side dispute experts lean toward physical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (removal plus dilution. None of these operators treats an oxidizer as a substitute for actual cleaning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The packout call is driven by damage load, not habit. Annissa Coy of FirehouseEducation sends medium to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (heavy fire jobs, and anything that needs ultrasonic work, to the warehouse. Light smoke gets cleaned in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (place to avoid the expense and hassle. Coy still runs a partial packout on light jobs when the structure) Tj ET
